  <section class="section" id="gamification">
    <span class="section-label">Progression</span>
    <h2>Gamification System</h2>
    <p>VibeCrew includes a persistent progression layer that motivates across sessions and teaches vibe-coding skills over time. Built on three principles: <strong>artifacts over actions</strong> (rewards map to real outputs), <strong>teaching over tracking</strong> (every mechanic helps you improve), and <strong>sustainable over addictive</strong> (grace periods, opt-in challenges, no toxic leaderboards).</p>

    <p>The gamification system uses the existing Vibe Score as its primary data source. Every metric flows from real work artifacts &mdash; shipped features, passing tests, clean sessions &mdash; not arbitrary actions.</p>

    <Callout type="info" title="How it integrates">
      The gamification pipeline runs automatically at the end of every <code>/wrap</code>. Six scripts execute sequentially: award XP, check badges, update streak, distribute skill XP, update challenges, and check level-ups. The <code>/achievements</code> command shows a compact CLI summary, and the VitePress dashboard provides the full visual experience.
    </Callout>

    <!-- XP & LEVELING -->
    <h3 id="xp-leveling">XP &amp; Leveling</h3>
    <p>XP is earned through real development work. Every source maps to existing tracked data &mdash; no gamification-only actions.</p>

