    <!-- STREAKS -->
    <h3 id="streaks">Streaks</h3>
    <p>Streaks track consecutive days of coding, designed to be encouraging rather than punitive.</p>

    <ul>
      <li><strong>Increment</strong> on calendar days where <code>/wrap</code> is run</li>
      <li><strong>Weekend auto-grace:</strong> Saturdays and Sundays don&rsquo;t break streaks and don&rsquo;t consume grace credits</li>
      <li><strong>2 grace days/month:</strong> Missing one weekday preserves the streak (resets on the 1st)</li>
      <li><strong>No penalty for broken streaks</strong> &mdash; the counter resets to 0 but no XP is lost</li>
      <li><strong>Streak reminders</strong> are opt-in (disabled by default in <code>config.json</code>)</li>
    </ul>

    <Callout type="tip" title="Sustainable by design">
      The weekend auto-grace and monthly grace days ensure that taking time off doesn&rsquo;t feel punishing. The system celebrates consistency without demanding it &mdash; a broken streak is just a number, not a loss.
    </Callout>

